<p>The external configuration utility is used to configure the toolset's database connection and to tell the toolset where the game's executable is and which server and database to connect to. You shouldn't need to run the configuration utility during routine usage of the toolset, and if the defaults set up by your installer work you may never need to run it at all.
</p>
